1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
One circuit. One continuous story.
A physical circuit becomes an inspectable model.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Look closer. Keep uncertainty visible.
Bounds and terminal candidates require human review.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:48,000
From wires to reasoning.
The surface disappears. Components and connections remain.

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The signal stops here.
Reversed LED polarity interrupts the illustrated path.

5
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:24,000
One correction. A clear path.
Disconnect power. Swap the LED terminals. Check again.

6
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Now, it is your circuit.
Generated observation, editable topology, engineering evidence.

7
00:01:44,000 --> 00:02:04,000
Trace the evidence everywhere.
Select D1 to connect the image, graph, properties and findings.

8
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Review before reasoning.
Accept, reject and correct observations before building the graph.

9
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:33,000
AI observes. Engineering rules reason.
An inspectable process, from image to diagnosis.

10
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:45,000
See the fault. Understand the fix.
Try CircuitLens. Follow the path to understanding.
